NAME
       vimtutor - a hands-on lesson for the vim editor

SYNOPSIS
       vimtutor [LANGUAGE]

DESCRIPTION
       vimtutor opens a copy of a lesson text in vim. You learn by doing what
       the text says: moving, deleting, inserting, saving, searching. The copy
       is thrown away at the end, so nothing can go wrong. It takes about half
       an hour and is the quickest way to get comfortable with vim. It comes
       with the vim-enhanced package.

EXAMPLES
           vimtutor

SEE ALSO
       vim(1)
